ernates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Kots Serein in Serenity Layout, <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/is-bellandur-a-good-place-to-live-in-bangalore\" target=\"_blank\">Bellandur</a> is located in the centre of Bangalore's Technology Corridor. With Embassy TechVillage (4.4 km), Ecospace Business Park (2.8 km), Wipro Gate (1.4 km), Microsoft (1.6 km), and Vaishnavi Tech Park (0.6 km), Kots Serein is at the nexus of Bangalore's major tech parks. Kots Serein is also connected to most important precincts of Bangalore — along Sarjapur Road and HSR Layout,&nbsp; thus affording residents easy commutes and a plethora of dining, shopping, and entertainment options.</span><p></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"></p><h2><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Thoughtfully Designed Living Spaces</b></span></h2><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span><p></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ad3b07e7-7fff-1364-d8fc-a01b5027a737\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Each apartment at Kots Serein is a prime example of modern style and functionality. The fully furnished apartments are decorated with high-quality furniture, custom-made wardrobes, modular kitchens with the latest distinct kitchenware, and 8\" pure foam mattresses for a restful night's sleep! Each apartment is airy, allowing for significant natural light and ventilation, ultimately promoting a calm living experience.</span></p>",
