    {
      "content": "<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><h2><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Community and Lifestyle</b></span></h2><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">In addition to the physical amenities, Kots Serein also encourages community. The rooftop garden creates a social and communal area where residents can relax and enjoy each other's company. A community should create a welcoming atmosphere where people feel a sense of belonging. The property's focus on security and maintenance will allow residents to spend their time in their personal or professional lives without worry about upkeep.</span></p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
